# API Routes - Simplified

## Simple Route Structure

This project uses **12 focused route files** with basic Express.js patterns.

## Route Organization

```
server/routes/
  index.js                 # Main router
  auth.routes.js          # Authentication
  participants.routes.js   # Participants CRUD
  rounds.routes.js        # Rounds CRUD
  news.routes.js          # News CRUD
  city-tips.routes.js     # City tips CRUD
  timetable.routes.js     # Timetable CRUD
  links.routes.js         # Links CRUD
  info-pages.routes.js    # Info pages CRUD
  schnellzugriff.routes.js # Quick access CRUD
  simplifiedRounds.routes.js # Simplified rounds
```

## Basic Route Patterns

### CRUD Routes
```javascript
// ✅ Simple CRUD pattern
router.get('/participants', async (req, res) => {
  try {
    const participants = await executeQuery('SELECT * FROM participants');
    res.json({ success: true, data: participants });
  } catch (error) {
    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });
  }
});

router.post('/participants', ...adminMiddleware(), async (req, res) => {
  try {
    const { name, region, instagram } = req.body;
    const result = await executeQuery(
      'INSERT INTO participants (name, region, instagram) VALUES ($1, $2, $3) RETURNING *',
      [name, region, instagram]
    );
    res.json({ success: true, data: result.rows[0] });
  } catch (error) {
    res.status(500).json({ success: false, error: error.message });
  }
});
```

### Authentication Middleware
```javascript
// ✅ Simple JWT authentication
const adminMiddleware = () => [
  authenticateCookie,
  authorize(['admin', 'organizer'])
];

router.post('/participants', ...adminMiddleware(), handler);
router.put('/participants/:id', ...adminMiddleware(), handler);
router.delete('/participants/:id', ...adminMiddleware(), handler);
```

### Error Handling
```javascript
// ✅ Simple error handling
try {
  const result = await executeQuery(query, params);
  res.json({ success: true, data: result.rows });
} catch (error) {
  logger.error('Database error:', error);
  res.status(500).json({ 
    success: false, 
    error: 'Internal server error' 
  });
}
```

## Anti-Patterns to Avoid

### ❌ Complex Middleware Chains
```javascript
// ❌ DON'T use complex middleware
router.post('/participants', 
  rateLimit({ windowMs: 15 * 60 * 1000, max: 100 }),
  validateSchema(participantSchema),
  sanitizeInput(),
  auditLog(),
  cacheMiddleware(),
  handler
);
```

### ❌ Complex Route Helpers
```javascript
// ❌ DON'T use complex route helpers
const result = await executeCrudOperation(
  'create',
  'participants',
  normalizedData,
  'CREATE_PARTICIPANT',
  res
);
```

### ❌ WebSocket Emissions
```javascript
// ❌ DON'T use WebSocket emissions
router.post('/participants', async (req, res) => {
  const result = await createParticipant(req.body);
  io.emit('participants:updated', result); // ❌ No WebSockets
  res.json(result);
});
```

## Route Patterns

### Public Routes
```javascript
// ✅ Simple public routes
router.get('/participants', getParticipants);
router.get('/rounds', getRounds);
router.get('/news', getNews);
```

### Admin Routes
```javascript
// ✅ Simple admin routes
router.post('/participants', ...adminMiddleware(), createParticipant);
router.put('/participants/:id', ...adminMiddleware(), updateParticipant);
router.delete('/participants/:id', ...adminMiddleware(), deleteParticipant);
```

### Authentication Routes
```javascript
// ✅ Simple auth routes
router.post('/auth/login', login);
router.post('/auth/logout', logout);
router.get('/auth/me', authenticateCookie, getCurrentUser);
```

## Benefits

- **Simple** - Easy to understand and debug
- **Maintainable** - Easy to modify and extend
- **Testable** - Simple to test
- **Performance** - No complex middleware overhead
- **Reliable** - Fewer points of failure

## Response Format

### Success Response
```javascript
{
  success: true,
  data: result,
  meta: {
    queryType: 'GET_PARTICIPANTS',
    duration: '45ms'
  }
}
```

### Error Response
```javascript
{
  success: false,
  error: 'Error message',
  code: 'VALIDATION_ERROR'
}
```

## Database Integration

### Simple Queries
```javascript
// ✅ Direct database queries
const participants = await executeQuery(
  'SELECT * FROM participants ORDER BY name',
  []
);

const participant = await executeQuery(
  'SELECT * FROM participants WHERE id = $1',
  [participantId]
);
```

### Transaction Handling
```javascript
// ✅ Simple transactions
const client = await pool.connect();
try {
  await client.query('BEGIN');
  const result = await client.query(query, params);
  await client.query('COMMIT');
  return result;
} catch (error) {
  await client.query('ROLLBACK');
  throw error;
} finally {
  client.release();
}
```